1
00:00:25,692 --> 00:00:28,070
Hey...

2
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:35,160
It's dangerous here...

3
00:00:38,247 --> 00:00:40,123
Fly away...

4
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:45,337
...somewhere... far away.

5
00:00:45,337 --> 00:00:46,380
Falco!

6
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,549
--Huh? What's my brother doing here?

7
00:00:48,549 --> 00:00:49,591
--Good!
--Huh? What's my brother doing here?

8
00:00:49,591 --> 00:00:50,884
You're still talking!

9
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:52,678
Colt!

10
00:00:52,678 --> 00:00:54,888
Time to run! Hold on!

11
00:01:05,566 --> 00:01:06,733
Falco!

12
00:01:13,115 --> 00:01:15,492
Colt? Status report?

13
00:01:17,911 --> 00:01:20,038
It was a direct hit.

14
00:01:22,499 --> 00:01:26,003
The Eldian unit at the front got blown away.

15
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,422
And the trench?

16
00:01:28,422 --> 00:01:31,592
It's hopeless! We can't dig any farther!

17
00:01:31,592 --> 00:01:36,263
We can't? You're calling the shots?
An Eldian, giving orders?

18
00:01:36,263 --> 00:01:39,683
Watch your tone with
Commander Magath, you mutt!

19
00:01:39,683 --> 00:01:43,145
But... at this rate...

20
00:01:43,145 --> 00:01:45,439
Falco, are you drunk?

21
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:47,774
He must've hit his head good.

22
00:01:47,774 --> 00:01:51,945
Do you remember this war
we've been in for four years?

23
00:01:51,945 --> 00:01:55,240
Who... are you guys?

24
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,618
Wait... Huh?

25
00:01:57,618 --> 00:02:01,622
Wasn't I flying around
with a sword just now?

26
00:02:01,622 --> 00:02:05,501
Like, whoosh!
And there were Titans that I--

27
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:10,797
Guess I'll just have to explain
everything from the start.

28
00:02:10,797 --> 00:02:13,675
Listen up good, Falco.

29
00:02:13,675 --> 00:02:19,598
This battle is the climax of a war
that's lasted four years.

30
00:02:19,598 --> 00:02:22,851
If we can take out Fort Slava...

31
00:02:22,851 --> 00:02:28,607
Well, technically, if we sink the Mid-East
Allied Forces fleet in its port...

32
00:02:28,607 --> 00:02:33,445
...it'll spell victory for Marley
and end the war.

33
00:02:33,445 --> 00:02:38,116
But unless we take Fort Slava
sitting on the high ground,

34
00:02:38,116 --> 00:02:40,994
it's hopeless to attack the port.

35
00:02:41,912 --> 00:02:44,915
Why can't the Marley fleet just do it?

36
00:02:44,915 --> 00:02:48,544
Seriously, Zofia?!
You have faith in the fleet?!

37
00:02:48,544 --> 00:02:51,421
--It took those imbeciles four
years to control the seas!

38
00:02:51,421 --> 00:02:52,548
--Ow! Ow, Ow! Ugh! Ow!
--It took those imbeciles four
years to control the seas!

39
00:02:52,548 --> 00:02:57,094
--Ow! Ow, Ow! Ugh! Ow!
--And guess what?! They lost
half their damn ships doing it!

40
00:02:57,094 --> 00:03:03,058
Now they're telling us they're too
chicken to attack till we take the fort?!

41
00:03:03,058 --> 00:03:05,477
Screw 'em all! They're pricks!

42
00:03:05,477 --> 00:03:09,147
Udo, you're gonna squeeze Falco's head off.

43
00:03:09,147 --> 00:03:11,984
Whoops! Sorry!

44
00:03:11,984 --> 00:03:17,990
So what's the deal? Why'd they send us
Warrior candidates to the front lines?

45
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:20,534
To judge us, obviously.

46
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:24,788
To pick which one of us
will be the next Warrior.

47
00:03:26,915 --> 00:03:28,917
The time is coming.

48
00:03:28,917 --> 00:03:33,046
Commander Magath chose the
front lines to be our final test.

49
00:03:33,046 --> 00:03:36,592
He knows what's on the horizon.

50
00:03:36,592 --> 00:03:40,220
The plan to conquer Paradis
needs a main player--

51
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:43,265
the successor of the Armored Titan!

52
00:05:15,065 --> 00:05:20,070
"The Other Side of the Sea"

53
00:05:24,741 --> 00:05:26,869
The Armored Titan...

54
00:05:27,661 --> 00:05:30,873
I wonder which one of us it'll be...

55
00:05:33,041 --> 00:05:38,881
Really, Gabi? Sounds to me like you're
saying none of us come close to you.

56
00:05:38,881 --> 00:05:41,633
Because you don't, right?

57
00:05:41,633 --> 00:05:45,012
Well, Gabi does have us beat.

58
00:05:45,012 --> 00:05:46,847
As far as our grades go.

59
00:05:46,847 --> 00:05:51,685
No. There's more to it than grades, Udo.
I keep telling you.

60
00:05:51,685 --> 00:05:55,606
The difference between us
is that I'm prepared.

61
00:05:55,606 --> 00:05:58,025
To shoulder the fate of us Eldians...

62
00:05:58,025 --> 00:06:03,989
...and to slaughter that island of devils
who've done nothing but make us suffer!

63
00:06:03,989 --> 00:06:06,200
I'm gonna win this battle

64
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:11,371
and prove that the Eldians left
in this world are good Eldians!

65
00:06:11,371 --> 00:06:16,627
I refuse to lose till I free everyone
from the internment zone!

66
00:06:19,129 --> 00:06:23,383
Um, what exactly are you doing?

67
00:06:23,383 --> 00:06:25,219
Pretty cool, right?

68
00:06:25,219 --> 00:06:27,971
It won't work, Commander Magath!

69
00:06:27,971 --> 00:06:34,269
We can't destroy the railroad without
the machine gun slaughtering us first.

70
00:06:34,269 --> 00:06:37,773
They've got soldiers along
every inch of the trench.

71
00:06:37,773 --> 00:06:41,693
To top it off, the fort can
bombard us whenever they want.

72
00:06:41,693 --> 00:06:46,448
If we stay here too long,
they'll just shower us with shells!

73
00:06:46,448 --> 00:06:50,327
Do you have a better idea, Colt?

74
00:06:50,327 --> 00:06:54,122
We should let Jaw and Cart loose.

75
00:06:54,122 --> 00:06:56,875
Galliard and Pieck will get it done.

76
00:06:56,875 --> 00:07:00,295
They'll wipe out the trench
and bunker in a flash.

77
00:07:00,295 --> 00:07:02,256
No.

78
00:07:02,256 --> 00:07:05,425
If we play our cards wrong, we lose.

79
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:09,054
Commander Magath, "that" showed up.

80
00:07:09,054 --> 00:07:11,723
What's "that"?

81
00:07:11,723 --> 00:07:14,977
That. An armored train.

82
00:07:14,977 --> 00:07:18,897
It's equipped with four
massive cannons in total.

83
00:07:18,897 --> 00:07:22,901
They're the Allied Forces' new
weapon--anti-Titan cannons.

84
00:07:22,901 --> 00:07:28,949
If one of those 150mm rounds hits
a Titan, it'll kill it in a single hit.

85
00:07:28,949 --> 00:07:31,368
Even one of the Nine.

86
00:07:31,368 --> 00:07:36,707
But both of our Titans are incredibly fast.
The odds of hitting their nape--

87
00:07:36,707 --> 00:07:39,209
And if they did?

88
00:07:39,209 --> 00:07:42,838
We would lose a Titan and a Warrior...

89
00:07:42,838 --> 00:07:46,383
...with no guarantee that
we get their powers back.

90
00:07:46,383 --> 00:07:52,472
That's right. Just like our plan nine
years ago to retake the Founding Titan

91
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:56,727
resulted in us losing the
Colossal and Female Titan.

92
00:07:56,727 --> 00:08:02,441
The perceived hit to Marley's military
might is what sparked this war,

93
00:08:02,441 --> 00:08:06,028
putting the Paradis Island Operation on hold.

94
00:08:06,028 --> 00:08:10,282
What is it that makes our
motherland Marley so great?

95
00:08:10,282 --> 00:08:12,284
The Power of the Titans.

96
00:08:12,284 --> 00:08:16,955
Correct. Our nation won't last
if we keep losing 'em.

97
00:08:16,955 --> 00:08:22,544
The Power of the Titans is absolute,
and it must always remain that way.

98
00:08:22,544 --> 00:08:25,339
Prepare the Eldian unit for attack!

99
00:08:25,339 --> 00:08:26,340
Yes, sir!

100
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:28,091
Commander Magath! But that's--

101
00:08:28,091 --> 00:08:30,594
What's the matter, Eldian?

102
00:08:30,594 --> 00:08:34,932
Are you not warriors who
swore loyalty to Marley?

103
00:08:36,391 --> 00:08:39,978
This is a chance for the 800 Eldians here...

104
00:08:39,978 --> 00:08:44,274
...to serve our motherland with honor.

105
00:08:49,112 --> 00:08:51,990
All creatures drink of joy at nature's breast...

106
00:08:51,990 --> 00:08:55,285
Everyone up! Prepare to attack!

107
00:08:56,703 --> 00:08:59,373
C'mon! Stand up!

108
00:08:59,373 --> 00:09:00,624
Eldians!

109
00:09:00,624 --> 00:09:06,588
Your mission is to assault and
destroy the enemy railroad!

110
00:09:06,588 --> 00:09:11,718
The suicide squad will rush the bunker
and disable the machine gun!

111
00:09:11,718 --> 00:09:17,349
Listen up! Let your actions purge the
disgrace of being spawn of the devil!

112
00:09:17,349 --> 00:09:22,062
This is your chance to be honored
by our great motherland Marley!

113
00:09:22,062 --> 00:09:23,814
Prove yourselves worthy!

114
00:09:23,814 --> 00:09:25,399
Yes, sir!

115
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:28,902
You Warrior candidates are to stand by.

116
00:09:28,902 --> 00:09:35,409
The 800-strong Eldian unit must
destroy the rail at whatever cost.

117
00:09:35,409 --> 00:09:39,329
As long as that armored
train is patrolling the fort,

118
00:09:39,329 --> 00:09:43,584
the Armored and Beast Titan
can't do what they came for.

119
00:09:43,584 --> 00:09:45,043
But...

120
00:09:45,961 --> 00:09:49,590
Colt. As the chosen successor
of the Beast Titan,

121
00:09:49,590 --> 00:09:53,677
learn what it means to lead already.

122
00:10:01,143 --> 00:10:04,730
Perfect. We can destroy the train, too.

123
00:10:04,730 --> 00:10:07,316
Please, let me take a shot at it.

124
00:10:07,316 --> 00:10:09,776
--Huh?
--Ta-da!

125
00:10:09,776 --> 00:10:14,406
If you'll let me, I can disable
the armored train all on my own!

126
00:10:15,741 --> 00:10:17,492
Hey, Gabi!

127
00:10:17,492 --> 00:10:23,081
How much do you think Marley's spent
training you all these years? Hell no.

128
00:10:23,081 --> 00:10:27,461
It's true... I am exceptional
compared to Falco and the others.

129
00:10:27,461 --> 00:10:32,382
There may never be another
Warrior as talented as I am.

130
00:10:32,382 --> 00:10:35,511
Not to mention one this cute.

131
00:10:35,511 --> 00:10:41,350
But if I succeed, we won't lose
the whole unit of 800 Eldians!

132
00:10:41,350 --> 00:10:43,060
And if you fail?

133
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:48,899
You lose just one promising candidate
and seven hand grenades.

134
00:10:52,069 --> 00:10:58,242
If you think I'm more valuable than 800
Eldian soldiers, I totally understand.

135
00:10:58,242 --> 00:11:03,539
You love me so much that you'd rather sacrifice
the lives of 800 soldiers over me--

136
00:11:03,539 --> 00:11:05,165
Fine.

137
00:11:06,124 --> 00:11:07,876
Go ahead.

138
00:11:07,876 --> 00:11:09,253
Gabi, don't--

139
00:11:09,253 --> 00:11:16,093
I swear! I will prove to you that I'm worthy
of inheriting the Armored Titan!

140
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:21,640
What are you doing?

141
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,809
For this to succeed...

142
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:28,146
...please allow me to remove my armband.

143
00:11:28,146 --> 00:11:29,648
Very well.

144
00:11:36,405 --> 00:11:39,616
Hey, someone's coming this way.

145
00:11:41,785 --> 00:11:46,290
It's a woman. Girl, actually.
I think she's surrendering.

146
00:11:46,290 --> 00:11:49,126
No, wait. She might be Eldian.

147
00:11:49,126 --> 00:11:54,381
It looks like something's wrong with her.
She's dragging her leg.

148
00:11:56,133 --> 00:12:00,345
What if she's Eldian?
Shoot her before she turns into a Titan.

149
00:12:00,345 --> 00:12:04,308
Screw that. If you wanna
shoot her, you do it!

150
00:12:05,517 --> 00:12:06,935
Shit.

151
00:12:12,065 --> 00:12:13,400
What the--?

152
00:12:24,953 --> 00:12:26,163
Wait...

153
00:12:28,749 --> 00:12:30,042
Wait for it!

154
00:12:33,712 --> 00:12:35,047
Wait!

155
00:12:35,047 --> 00:12:36,131
She ain't moving.

156
00:12:36,131 --> 00:12:38,050
Who cares? Shoot her!

157
00:12:42,137 --> 00:12:46,391
Now's my chance!

158
00:12:55,651 --> 00:12:57,569
She really did it!

159
00:12:57,569 --> 00:12:59,738
Galliard! Hurry up!

160
00:13:03,283 --> 00:13:07,371
Dammit! You Marleyan cowards!

161
00:13:07,371 --> 00:13:11,208
This is why you bastards...

162
00:13:11,208 --> 00:13:14,253
...all deserve to die!

163
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:17,881
Gabi!

164
00:13:17,881 --> 00:13:19,508
Falco, don't!

165
00:13:37,901 --> 00:13:40,237
Galliard! Huh?

166
00:13:54,918 --> 00:13:57,588
The armored train has been disabled.

167
00:13:57,588 --> 00:14:00,632
We'll now commence the airborne assault.

168
00:14:00,632 --> 00:14:03,010
Remember to stick to the plan.

169
00:14:03,010 --> 00:14:07,556
Zeke will be our spear...
and Reiner will be our shield.

170
00:14:08,056 --> 00:14:13,061
"Marley: A Military Dictatorship"
"Utilizing seven of the Nine Titans as
'Warriors,' Marley conquers enemy nations
with their overwhelming strength."

171
00:15:12,663 --> 00:15:14,164
Damn, that hurts!

172
00:15:14,164 --> 00:15:16,542
Why'd a Marleyan like me get shot at?!

173
00:15:16,542 --> 00:15:19,002
--What are you doing, Falco?
--You Eldians are supposed
to soak up the bullets!

174
00:15:19,002 --> 00:15:20,879
--Can't you tell?
--You Eldians are supposed
to soak up the bullets!

175
00:15:20,879 --> 00:15:24,007
He's in no shape to fight us anymore.

176
00:15:24,007 --> 00:15:25,843
Udo, gimme a tourniquet.

177
00:15:25,843 --> 00:15:27,177
--Here.
--Stupid kids.

178
00:15:27,177 --> 00:15:30,138
Screw the enemy.

179
00:15:30,138 --> 00:15:33,350
Is that supposed to be your selling point?

180
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:39,398
You really think obeying the laws of war
will earn you the spot of Armored Titan?

181
00:15:39,398 --> 00:15:42,025
It's not gonna help, you know.

182
00:15:42,025 --> 00:15:43,610
Like I care?

183
00:15:44,945 --> 00:15:46,613
Weirdo.

184
00:15:48,365 --> 00:15:50,075
He's saying something.

185
00:15:53,912 --> 00:15:58,417
Interpret, Udo. Say I stopped his
bleeding and that he'll be fine--

186
00:15:58,417 --> 00:16:00,335
"Don't touch me."

187
00:16:00,335 --> 00:16:02,629
"I'll be tainted."

188
00:16:02,629 --> 00:16:05,507
"You devil," he says.

189
00:16:15,893 --> 00:16:17,477
Retreat!

190
00:16:17,477 --> 00:16:18,937
Hurry up!

191
00:16:18,937 --> 00:16:20,230
Get away from the fort!

192
00:16:20,230 --> 00:16:22,149
Don't get caught in it!

193
00:16:26,945 --> 00:16:28,739
It's begun.

194
00:16:59,228 --> 00:17:00,687
Ahem!

195
00:17:52,114 --> 00:17:54,658
No! Stop!

196
00:18:01,582 --> 00:18:05,878
Truly devils...

197
00:18:05,878 --> 00:18:11,466
Our Marleyan ancestors
were eaten, just like that.

198
00:18:11,466 --> 00:18:13,760
By you Eldians.

199
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,304
Fire!

200
00:18:25,189 --> 00:18:27,774
The kinetic bombardment went well,

201
00:18:27,774 --> 00:18:32,863
but due to the altitude,
roughly half died on impact.

202
00:18:33,989 --> 00:18:38,118
A lot of the anti-Titan cannons
are still operational.

203
00:18:38,118 --> 00:18:44,374
Twenty-eight... Twenty-nine...
And now I know their locations. But still...

204
00:18:45,667 --> 00:18:47,669
More walls?

205
00:18:49,421 --> 00:18:53,050
I'm sick and tired... of walls.

206
00:19:11,527 --> 00:19:14,154
--It's the Armored!
--Kill it!

207
00:19:21,954 --> 00:19:23,539
Fire!

208
00:19:26,667 --> 00:19:31,004
Anti-Titan shells that
penetrate even my armor?

209
00:19:34,091 --> 00:19:36,802
What the--?! What hit me?!

210
00:19:37,928 --> 00:19:41,014
An armored train? There's another?

211
00:20:00,784 --> 00:20:02,035
Shit!

212
00:20:02,035 --> 00:20:03,495
Fire--

213
00:20:08,125 --> 00:20:09,793
Galliard!

214
00:20:09,793 --> 00:20:12,045
You son of a whore!

215
00:20:44,286 --> 00:20:45,537
Nice!

216
00:20:53,128 --> 00:20:56,048
They got it under control?

217
00:20:56,048 --> 00:21:00,344
Our defeat brought about this war, Reiner.

218
00:21:10,979 --> 00:21:14,107
Isn't war a terrible thing?

219
00:21:29,206 --> 00:21:33,961
Finally... With this, the war will be over.

220
00:21:41,927 --> 00:21:43,053
Huh?

221
00:21:43,053 --> 00:21:44,346
What?!

222
00:22:18,172 --> 00:22:20,924
With their fleet destroyed,

223
00:22:20,924 --> 00:22:25,179
the Mid-East Allied Forces signed
a peace treaty with Marley.

224
00:22:25,179 --> 00:22:30,350
The war spanning four years
ended in a Marleyan victory.

225
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:37,691
But as the world learned that the era
of Titan domination was coming to an end,

226
00:22:37,691 --> 00:22:43,906
Marley was pressed to obtain the
Founding Titan as quickly as possible.

227
00:22:45,073 --> 00:22:47,201
Oh, no...

228
00:22:50,913 --> 00:22:56,627
Thanks to the incredible bravery of the
Marley army, Fort Slava has fallen at last!

229
00:22:56,627 --> 00:22:58,212
Unbelievable!

230
00:22:58,212 --> 00:23:01,048
That's our Marley army for you!

231
00:23:57,521 --> 00:24:03,068
"Titans are not absolute."
Marley was shown this painful reality.

232
00:24:03,068 --> 00:24:05,863
Victory providing a brief joy,

233
00:24:05,863 --> 00:24:12,096
the warriors return to
their hometown of Liberio.
